11/3/71                                                    SYS STIME (II)

N AME         stime -- set time

SYNOPSIS      (time in AC--MQ)
              sys      stime      / stime = 25.; not in assembler

DESCRIPTION   stime sets the system's idea of the time and date. Only the super--
              user may use this call.

FILES

SEE ALSO      sys time

DIAGNOSTICS   Error bit (c--bit) set if user is not the super-- user.

